# #   Option A (path-based):    https://localhost/ollama
# # For HTTPS (Caddy): trust Caddy's local CA so Node/fetch and browsers don't hit cert errors; see docs/monorepo/Ollama.md and tools/caddy/README.md.
# # See AGENTS.md and databases/README.md.

# # OLLAMA_BASE_URL="http://localhost:11434"
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL="https://ollama.local"
# OLLAMA_EMBEDDING_MODEL="nomic-embed-text"

# # When Ollama is behind Caddy (or accessed from browsers), set OLLAMA_ORIGINS so CORS allows requests.
